<body>
    <h1>Disconnect</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<p>The "Disconnect" panel serves as a tool within the IVR system to disconn=
ect calls under specific scenarios. This may include disconnecting calls fo=
r black listed callers, as defined by IVR settings, following the playback =
of a closure prompt, and other similar events.</p><span class=3D"confluence=
-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size=
"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" width=3D"260" loadi=
ng=3D"lazy" src=3D"8d4ba8dfaf17e61662f04fe36be6736917d99ac2138bcb7ba00ac821=
07e1058a" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/download/a=
ttachments/3424550932/Screenshot%202024-10-29%20at%2010.00.26%E2%80%AFAM.pn=
g?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1730221338614&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp=
;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"108" data-width=3D"360" data-unresolved-comment-c=
ount=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4243193866" data-linked-resource-vers=
ion=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-def=
ault-alias=3D"Screenshot 2024-10-29 at 10.00.26=E2=80=AFAM.png" data-base-u=
rl=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-ty=
pe=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"3424550932" data-link=
ed-resource-container-version=3D"8" data-media-id=3D"ddb831e8-d7ad-40e9-a06=
0-322e297df22c" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"78"></span>
<h3 id=3D"Disconnect-Configuration">Configuration</h3>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout two-equal" data-layout=3D"two-equal">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Set as Flow Initiator:</strong> Selecting "Set as Flow Initiator=
" designates this panel as the starting point of the IVR flow, initiating t=
he sequence before progressing to subsequent panels within the Logic+ flow.=
</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Panel Name:</strong> Choose a consistent name for the panel.</p>=
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Panel Description:</strong> Provide a clear description detailin=
g the panel's purpose and functionality. This acts as documentation, facili=
tating better understanding and identification of the panel's intended use =
by others.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Exit Paths:</strong> Use the dropdown menu to select another pan=
el in your flow. Any output from this panel will advance to the linked pane=
l.</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Default</strong>: The Default path is taken upon regular panel e=
xecution (disconnection).</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Error</strong>: This path is taken if there was an error.</p></l=
i>
</ol></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<p></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper=
